From 8af986f94c0ba72155005e5dae45e2583c10a84c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 12:07:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] feat: Add per-gaussian view scores (computeViewScores)

Score every gaussian by its contribution to a set of views: the sum over
pixels of its blending weight, accumulated in the scene rasterizer and
resolved to source rows on the GPU. Resident tier only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01RfkFS6mjG8zdavwCoa7Kk9
